sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Browser Client
    participant Edge as Cloudflare Edge
    participant Static as Static Assets
    participant Fn as Pages Function
    participant D1 as D1 Database

    Client->>Edge: Request page
    Edge->>Static: Serve HTML, CSS, JS
    Static-->>Client: Page with policy headers (no Function)
    Client->>Edge: Submit contact / CSP reports
    Edge->>Fn: /api/* only
    Fn->>D1: Parameterized SQL write
